{"id":1023,"status":"Fixed","summary":"Assigning object literals to obj.prototype in a immediately executed function not recognized.","labels":["Type-Defect","Priority-Medium"],"stars":0,"commentCount":7,"comments":[{"id":0,"commenterId":5466112693174441437,"content":"/** @constructor */
